<title>UK: S-E-Banken prices 100 mln stg perpetual.</title>
<headline>S-E-Banken prices 100 mln stg perpetual.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated perpetual step-up hybrid bond has been priced, lead manager Goldman Sachs International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SKANDINAVISKA ENSKILDA BANKEN (S-E-BANKEN)</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   MARGIN   * 9.04	MATURITY ** UNDATED</p>
<p>			    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  62.5 BP   REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+120 BP</p>
<p> MOODY(SUB) BAA1	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P(SUB)   BBB	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  37.5 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT DECEMBER 2006 GILT</p>
<p>NOTES * MARGIN STEPS UP TO 6MLIBOR PLUS 250 BP FROM 11.DEC.06</p>
<p>	 **CALL AT PAR FROM 11.DEC.06</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
